{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お雛様とお内裏様と、、、お日奈さ～ん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！71回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nペイマさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは、あれですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755の動画。。(｡-∀-｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、朝方までずっと寝れなくて\n睡眠時間1時間ちょっとで\n動いていろいろな景色を見ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議といまは眠たくない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方はめっちゃねむたくて\nまいちゅんと話しながら\n寝そうになりました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんとは、よく相部屋になるので\nたくさん話すんだけど、\n眠たくなります(ノ_・。)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね、まいちゅん。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このまいちゅん\n美人さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから！今日はひなまつり！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校1年生のとき\nお雛様をお母さんと飾っていたら\n二期生3次審査通過の電話がかかってきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが思い出！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃は\n立派な7段のお雛様をかざって\n私と妹となぜかお兄ちゃんと3人で\n写真を撮ってもらってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃は、わたあめやひなあられが\nたくさん食べられるひな祭りが\nハッピーな1日だったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生になってそんなにひな祭りに興味がなくなり、ただ綿あめを食べて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近またひな祭りにウキウキするようになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな祭りは、女の子の特別な日だからね(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小樽のおばあちゃんから\n「おひな」って、小さいころ呼ばれてたんだけど\n乃木坂にひなが3人いて\nひなぴょん、ひなちま、おひな\nの並び結構好きだなと思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おひな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おひなって呼んでもいいよ٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶皆さん(｡-∀-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  Tsuyoshiさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎ひなこ✋(◉ ω ◉｀)よお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎Tsuyoshiさん(  ˙︶˙  )ゝよお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  つばささん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎冒頭の挨拶:今日はひな祭り...ひな祭り...日奈子祭り...日奈子フェスティバル？という訳で日奈子フェスティバル開幕！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ヒナコセレクトに選ばれてしまった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子フェスティバル！！！\nぜひ開幕したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  たかさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎マンガといっしょに撮った写真はスッピンですかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎スッピンですね。目がないです。顔がうすい。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(303)  めぐさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃん ！！ 何ケーキが好き（？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ショートケーキ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホイップクリームがだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  石ちゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎おすすめのストレス発散方法はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ストレスの原因がわかっているのならば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"解決できるか考えて\n周りの人に相談したり泣いたり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単なストレス発散は、\n好きなものをたくさん食べて\n寝る！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにておわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n63回目はすさんさんからです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後は乃木坂のひな3ショットでばいばーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/1197215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ps.ハルジオンが咲く頃の個別握手会が\n全会場完売したとききました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく嬉しく幸せです。\n握手会は、私にとって\nエネルギーが満たされる\n笑顔になれる幸せになれる\n大切でだいすきな場であります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方と会えることを\n楽しみにしています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっとがんばります！"}],"source":"archive"}